{"title":"1963 IMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/1748503c70a66d1790d7df298e9ae34682dd8706.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{\\frac{\\pi}{7}}-\\cos{\\frac{2\\pi}{7}}+\\cos{\\frac{3\\pi}{7}}=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"225\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because the sum of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-coordinates of the seventh roots of unity is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we have \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/0/a007ff617d8d494b1a03c85a712aab69fba81313.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos{\\frac{2\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{4\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{6\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{8\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{10\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{12\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{14\\pi}{7}} = 0\\]\" width=\"539\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/a/34a6bec4d0bcd0a8bf299db9431bbd316a94a2a3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos{\\frac{2\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{4\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{6\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{8\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{10\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{12\\pi}{7}} = -1\\]\" width=\"478\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/1/fe16a6e01f4b272e7667373b4197d0820cc55e73.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos{\\frac{2\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{4\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{6\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\left(-\\frac{6\\pi}{7}\\right)} + \\cos{\\left(-\\frac{4\\pi}{7}\\right)} + \\cos{\\left(-\\frac{2\\pi}{7}\\right)} = -1.\\]\" width=\"550\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Now, we can apply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/8/61818e2a29b4162ad7b67e7867df55374a9555d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{x} = \\cos{\\left(-x\\right)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"20\" /> to obtain\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/7/6676208d53c9035e478515f1c5fcfcfca4fdc3c7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\left(\\cos{\\frac{2\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{4\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{6\\pi}{7}}\\right) = -1\\]\" width=\"283\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/0/8302b445ccc9e365790c837d80d5f7fe0991ab23.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos{\\frac{2\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{4\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{6\\pi}{7}} = -\\frac{1}{2}.\\]\" width=\"253\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Finally, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/6/91660a8291834bd9b6abe0943c1ed302b50aff5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{x} = -\\cos{(\\pi-x)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"20\" />, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/3/043473a601b6f1d3cfa2952965163a5a39fc555b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos{\\frac{2\\pi}{7}} - \\cos{\\frac{3\\pi}{7}} - \\cos{\\frac{\\pi}{7}} = -\\frac{1}{2}\\]\" width=\"239\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/8/db8f570b55103c42b2b062348c989900824f78f7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos{\\frac{\\pi}{7}} - \\cos{\\frac{2\\pi}{7}} + \\cos{\\frac{3\\pi}{7}} = \\frac{1}{2}\\textrm{. }\\square\\]\" width=\"251\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>~mathboy100\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/4/204ecd072c905bf2f1f3a8abbfd393288cc8bfd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{\\frac{\\pi}{7}}-\\cos{\\frac{2\\pi}{7}}+\\cos{\\frac{3\\pi}{7}}=S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"226\" height=\"37\" />. We have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/5/975d13a7b09cb30493a8944009bba2c948d3fc20.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S=\\cos{\\frac{\\pi}{7}}-\\cos{\\frac{2\\pi}{7}}+\\cos{\\frac{3\\pi}{7}}=\\cos{\\frac{\\pi}{7}}+\\cos{\\frac{3\\pi}{7}}+\\cos{\\frac{5\\pi}{7}}\\]\" width=\"438\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Then, by product-sum formulae, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fa439c41efcd3da306bca24a69b3b88d35ffff5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S \\cdot 2 \\sin{\\frac{\\pi}{7}} = \\sin{\\frac{2\\pi}{7}}+\\sin{\\frac{4\\pi}{7}}-\\sin{\\frac{2\\pi}{7}}+\\sin{\\frac{6\\pi}{7}}-\\sin{\\frac{4\\pi}{7}}=\\sin{\\frac{6\\pi}{7}}=\\sin{\\frac{\\pi}{7}}\\]\" width=\"538\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/6/3c649b271fc1e17c76b02f571397fb7cb7670cb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = 1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/e/b5eec325944ef50e50199e87177b3c11e9dbe957.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\sin{\\frac{\\pi}{7}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"72\" height=\"33\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/5/3c5c3fb8bd97fcf4cd684ffb392f1bc3c6ce2498.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\cos{\\frac{\\pi}{7}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"73\" height=\"33\" />. From the addition formulae, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/4/584ad789c1e27be303e8a6a01ab2be5a0720a817.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S=b-[b^2-a^2]+[ b(b^2-a^2)-a(2ab) ]=b-b^2+b^3+a^2(1-3b)\\]\" width=\"478\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>From the Trigonometric Identity, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/a/7ea0fa11624dae0e2ba6722d026e9792d7c4544e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2=1-b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" />, so\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/e/07e5ff976948bc5ff5b5d3dfcd81a9423c9627ee.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S=b-b^2+b^3+(1-b^2)(1-3b)=4b^3-2b^2-2b+1\\]\" width=\"428\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>We must prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/5/3e517c1a8e59c653566bef38ef15241468db6f18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />. It suffices to show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7182e30cc72a20decf65f5ed36ea43e8f6e25a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8b^3-4b^2-4b+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"174\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Now note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/d/25deec9af1fd5c9532c77e71984dc2f151a9e644.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{\\frac{4\\pi}{7}}=-\\cos{\\frac{3\\pi}{7}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"142\" height=\"37\" />. We can find these in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/d/4cd4b56fd758b4400d34bd9dc22c949f03602fe2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos{\\frac{4\\pi}{7}}=[b^2-a^2]^2-[2ab]^2=b^4-6a^2b^2+b^4=b^4-6(1-b^2)b^2+b^4=8b^4-8b^2+1\\]\" width=\"591\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/a/56ae103b8a53d62ca03bc58b32ae73c3f93ada1b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos{\\frac{3\\pi}{7}}=b[b^2-a^2]-a[2ab]=b^3-3a^2b=b^3-3(1-b^2)b=3b-4b^3\\]\" width=\"489\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/6/d36eb4fe2bb87ef5a5566ef9498f41ab05d9b47b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8b^4-8b^2+1=-(3b-4b^3)\\Rightarrow 8b^4+4b^3-8b^2-3b+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"467\" height=\"19\" />. Note that this can be factored:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/d/69d12aa4d163d8c7d7726960785229462ace8952.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8b^4+4b^3-8b^2-3b+1=(8b^3-4b^2-4b+1)(b+1)=0\\]\" width=\"453\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Clearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/e/a9ee6def7ab51d20054ffc5cefd5e925bcadb862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\neq -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7182e30cc72a20decf65f5ed36ea43e8f6e25a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8b^3-4b^2-4b+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"174\" height=\"16\" />. This proves the result. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/5/505c1ffdbc8c453052c6968c89ff62007760297c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega=\\mathrm{cis}\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{14}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"35\" />. Thus it suffices to show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/f/22fd0706f07d93d573cb0ea533de627e38cd7982.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega+\\omega^{-1}-\\omega^2-\\omega^{-2}+\\omega^3+\\omega^{-3}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"286\" height=\"18\" />. Now using the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/3/793a236ab69b1f906ffeca46ac2d22f16386f3fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega^k=\\omega^{14+k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b00bae049a831e84817a85078b64f0c9bc5569f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\omega^2=\\omega^9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" />, this is equivalent to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79420f5553b8ddf8a7c59fa15fcf5cd615bfc48.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\omega+\\omega^3+\\omega^5+\\omega^7+\\omega^9+\\omega^{11}+\\omega^{13}-\\omega^7\\]\" width=\"316\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/4/5c4ac7d341fdd6278b4bc7f9934453c45c8f1ad1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\omega\\left(\\frac{\\omega^{14}-1}{\\omega^2-1}\\right)-\\omega^7\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"43\" />\nBut since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/d/54d7d48553f4d9e7ab418118607ea324cbfddfda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />th root of unity, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/0/660f19ec92a9b4d5fbba1710b3a3dd278f9cac2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega^{14}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />. The answer is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/a/b0aa28e1f45f33b650a042d2531e47812dbb90c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\omega^{7}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />, as desired.\n</p><p>~yofro\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/9/2a94b47042f23b197379f240f68e9e8f02352045.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega = \\mathrm{cis} \\ \\left(\\dfrac{2\\pi}{7} \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"117\" height=\"45\" />. We therefore have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d043cae61bd94f75b18a7d8ee96129b3b25e05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w^i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/9/80974eb34de691a4bb708f618ffe72a0db430bd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\leq i \\leq 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" />, are the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/7/6f78e78f4310b0b7c8cf8071ff2ef99c35642aff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{\\text{th}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" /> roots of unity. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/5/f5514dbed15c5643951dea9a62e0cb5fa4a306ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i = 0}^6 \\omega^i = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"81\" height=\"55\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05f3309ad503c8c686effe1cc5b0942b89aa5cba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i = 1}^6 \\omega^i = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"95\" height=\"55\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/b/acbd595491a2545eb357e868dcf63e90e7b6aaf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i = 1}^3 \\mathrm{Re}(\\omega^i) = -\\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"135\" height=\"55\" />. Therefore, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c65f02888ac5de39b40cabd05f7ec47acd81971.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{cis} \\ \\alpha = \\cos \\alpha + i \\sin \\alpha, \\mathrm{Re}(\\mathrm{cis} \\ \\alpha) = \\cos \\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"316\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/7/b97526e6e7e8d17534af1ed00dafdca456d0efe1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos \\left(\\dfrac{2\\pi}{7} \\right) + \\cos \\left( \\dfrac{4\\pi}{7} \\right) + \\cos \\left(\\dfrac{6\\pi}{7} \\right) = -\\dfrac{1}{2}\\]\" width=\"326\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/3/96322b033173a50779b17deb3f6e8c660265bf7a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies -\\cos \\left(\\dfrac{2\\pi}{7} \\right) - \\cos \\left(\\dfrac{4\\pi}{7} \\right) - \\cos \\left(\\dfrac{6\\pi}{7} \\right) = \\dfrac{1}{2}\\]\" width=\"368\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/b/18b82327998ee4d6308e696506452dc469f7849c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos \\alpha = - \\cos(\\pi - \\alpha)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"20\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/f/0aff7ba8bbd537caafeb0f0a466d2cebda4a3986.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos \\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{7} \\right) - \\cos \\left(\\dfrac{2\\pi}{7} \\right) + \\cos \\left(\\dfrac{3\\pi}{7} \\right) = \\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"302\" height=\"45\" /> and we are done <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Yiyj1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Yiyj1 (page does not exist)\">Yiyj1</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO\" title=\"1963 IMO\">1963 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1963 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1963 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1963 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1963 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6<